cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this code or the results in it, please cite the paper below."
title: "Federated Network-Level Sensing: code and derived results"
abstract: >-
  Analysis scripts and aggregate result files behind the paper "Federated
  Network-Level Sensing: Challenges and Lessons from Real-World Cellular Data".
  Includes the isolation-versus-scarcity intervention, the evaluation-hazard
  diagnostics, the observation-proportional federated rule and its factorial
  ablation. Raw measurements are not included.
